{"orgCode":"9840","name":"Augmentation for Contingencies or Emergencies","agencyCode":"8000","agencyName":"General Government","description":"Each year, the Budget Act includes appropriation items in business unit 9840 to be used to supplement department's appropriations that are insufficient due to unanticipated expenditures or emergency situations. There are three separate appropriations, one for each fund type - General, special, and non-governmental cost funds. These appropriations are allocated to other departments by the Department of Finance based upon the determination of need.","totals":{"amounts":{"py":0,"cy":38779,"by":55000},"positions":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":0},"excluded":{"nongovernmental":{"py":0,"cy":15000,"by":15000}}},"programs":{"id":"exp/8000/9840","kind":"department","name":"Augmentation for Contingencies or Emergencies","code":"9840","amounts":{"py":0,"cy":38779,"by":55000},"positions":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":0},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":0,"cy":28895,"by":40000},"special":{"py":0,"cy":9884,"by":15000}},"children":[{"id":"exp/8000/9840/7806","kind":"program","name":"Augmentation for Contingencies or Emergencies","code":"7806","amounts":{"py":0,"cy":38779,"by":55000},"byFundType":{"general":{"py":0,"cy":28895,"by":40000},"special":{"py":0,"cy":9884,"by":15000}},"positions":{"py":0,"cy":0,"by":0},"description":"7806 - AUGMENTATION FOR CONTINGENCIES OR EMERGENCIES\n\nThe 2024-25 and 2025-26 budget display for 9840 items of appropriations reflect the amounts allocated or to be allocated from 9840. A separate table has been provided for 2024-25 and 2025-26 that displays the detail of the allocations from 9840 and the unanticipated costs that have either been funded or are proposed to be funded from supplemental appropriations bills. Please see the \"2024-25 Unanticipated Cost Funding Table\" and the \"2025-26 Unanticipated Cost Funding Table\" for allocations from 9840 Items of Appropriations and Supplemental Appropriations Bills.","extra":{"byAppropria